@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
!include style.puml
' Straight segments retain readable relationship labels.
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
skinparam classBackgroundColor MODEL_COLOR
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 40
class ModelManager
class ActiveFilter
interface Predicate
class PersonSelectionPredicate
ModelManager --> "0..*" ActiveFilter : activeFilters
ModelManager --> Predicate : additionalFilters
ActiveFilter --> Predicate : predicate
PersonSelectionPredicate ..|> Predicate
note bottom of ActiveFilter
Name, email, tag and show conditions.
Each show wraps a PersonSelectionPredicate.
Removing a chip removes only that condition.
All predicates test a Person and combine with AND.
end note
@enduml
